/// Profile suggestions shipped with the hub. starter = created at the first start of the hub; all
/// are in the gallery and can be added any number of times. Adding copies the suggestion into an
/// independent profile (values = catalog defaults overlaid with rules; fixed and user_choice as
/// listed); an update of this file never changes existing profiles or devices. A higher version
/// makes the hub offer “new version of the suggestion” for profiles whose origin has an older
/// version (only with preview and confirmation).
/// Schema: `schemas/data/profile-suggestions.json`.
public struct DataProfileSuggestions: ContractValue {
    /// Catalog version the suggestions were written for.
    public var catalogVersion: Int
    public var suggestions: [DataProfileSuggestionsSuggestionsItem]

    public init(
        catalogVersion: Int,
