/// The one source for the quick access rules (widgets, controls, App Intents) of hub, Admin UI and
/// apps. Lookup like tile-capabilities: the first entry of domains[] whose domains list contains
/// the entity domain, else the entry with "_other". Effective level of an entity for a device =
/// min(admin level or default, domain max, device max quick_access_max); critical entities start at
/// status (default capped) and need critical_ack for control. Only entities in the device's read
/// scope (areas/tags, is_visible) count. Generated as a constant for every language (codegen
