/// Sent over the device's Home Assistant WebSocket while away from home: by the app of a family
/// manager device (family_* messages) and by a child device with remote access (kids_request,
/// kids_request_cancel). The integration takes the paired device from the calling HA user
/// (connection.user; never from the message), refuses every other user (HA error code
/// unauthorized), rate-limits per HA user and relays message to POST /api/integration/family. The
/// HA result (type result, success true) carries ha-ws-family.result.json; a hub that cannot be
/// reached answers success true with messages [family_error {reason: hub_unreachable}]. The hub
/// decides by the device: family_* only for family managers, kids_request* only for child devices
